    turnFlow: '1. **Ace Start**: As soon as an Ace appears in the tableau or from the stock, move it to the foundation area.\n2. **Building**: You can move a card from the Tableau to the Foundations if it is the next card in sequence and same suit (e.g., 8 on 7, 9 on 8... Jack on 10).\n3. **Reserve**: If a space is cleared in the Tableau, it is immediately filled by the top card of the Stock.\n4. **The Draw**: When no more moves are possible in the Tableau, deal cards from the stock one by one to see if they can be played to the foundations or placed in an empty tableau spot.',
